==Strategy==
These ten stages are pretty basic, mainly serving as a demonstration for the Omens. You shouldn't struggle too much given the weak support.

==='''Recommended Units'''===
*[[Cat Cactus]]: [[Immune to Surge|Surge Immune]] meatshield for the Omens.
*[[Talents|Talented]] [[Li'l Lizard Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l King Dragon]]: Surge Immune backliner that is good for the supporting enemies here.
*[[Maize Cat (Rare Cat)|Cone Cat]]: Works better than Cactus despite the latter's Surge Immunity.
*[[Elder Mask Doron (Special Cat)|Awakened Doron]]: Disposable source of [[Surge Attack]]s that occasionally hit everything for heavy damage. Doron's True Form is recommended for extra damage against Chibinel and the Omens, but his second form's fine as well.
*[[Elder Beast Naala (Special Cat)|Awakened Naala]]: Naala has high stats and can hit Sleipnir pretty reliably. Take caution when sending out Naala as she's outranged by the Omens.
*[[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jelly Dumpling Cat]]: Disposable unit that can use Aku Doge or peons to create a strong Wave. Generally not recommended due to the Omens flooding the stage with nasty Surges.
*[[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cyberpunk Cat]]: Backliner that helps with slowing both Omens and Sleipnir.
*Talented [[Nymph Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fiend Cat]]: The Omens here aren't buffed too much to where Fiend can stand a little bit of a chance. Using the peons, Fiend can [[Knockback]] both Sleipnir and the Omens.
*[[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]]: Good for general damage, and can occasionally net you extra cash.

